{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fresh take on spatial puzzles\u2014<strong>Quadcubes</strong> challenges you to think in three dimensions. Every move matters as you manipulate falling shapes around the X, Y and Z axes to complete and clear layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace in <strong>Relax Mode</strong>, or test your reflexes in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, where cleared layers speed up the descent of new pieces. <br>Choose a 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 playfield and tailor the difficulty to your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/extras/2539524645a9a8197b9bef84e1624797.avif?t=1756893301\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True 3D Rotation</strong> \u2013 Full freedom to spin and slide each block in all three axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Relax Mode for stress\u2011free play; Challenge Mode for escalating speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variable Playfields</strong> \u2013 Select 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 grids to scale complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design</strong> \u2013 Clean visuals keep the focus on puzzle\u2011solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Tracking</strong> \u2013 personal bests records to chase higher scores.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898080?t=1756893301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898080?t=1756893301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/3a3dddb7713fd99cdf9fb0c92c3a4fbff1adfdae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756893301","c